            <div xml:id="d796">

                <pb facs="0902" n="817" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg817"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">867.48/1097: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Sharp</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-11-29T19:00:00+00:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 29,
                                1918, 7 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received 8.53
                            p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>6069. My 6009, November 26, 2 a.m.<anchor n="10" xml:id="d796-f1"/> Note from
                    Foreign Office informs me that the French Government fully approves of the
                    sending of the personnel and material mentioned in the proposed assistance <pb
                        facs="0903" n="818" xml:id="pg818"/> by the Armenian and Syrian Relief
                    Society. Minister for Foreign Affairs adds that he has requested the Minister of
                    Marine to give appropriate instructions to the French Naval authorities at
                    Constantinople in order that all facilities may be accorded to the shipment.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sharp</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
